			// Executive summary page headline KPI — Financial pillar.
			// References [FWA Detection Rate %] from the Financial folder.
			// Dashboard target: benchmark within ±10% of audit expectation.
			// Maps to 'Claim Denial Rate' on the executive scorecard: fraud-flagged claims proxy denials.
